        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Huuu~&quot; is a 30-minute healing experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the days of recovery from illness, the protagonist begins to communicate with the wind. Guided by the breeze, they embark on a journey through the memories of the four seasons—healing old wounds and awakening the courage to reconcile with themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending natural aesthetics with adventure and puzzle-solving, the game introduces a unique form of natural interaction: <i>breathing</i>. Players take on the role of a breeze in <i>Hoo~</i>, accompanying and aiding the protagonist on their journey. The wind has shape and emotion—every breath resonates with the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players control the character’s actions and environmental changes through the intensity and rhythm of their breath. Breathing directly influences the world’s dynamics: a gentle, long breath sets feathers dancing through the air; a steady, short puff pushes the character forward; and a warm exhale can awaken slumbering plants and spirits.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Huuu~&quot; is a 30-minute healing experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the days of recovery from illness, the protagonist begins to communicate with the wind. Guided by the breeze, they embark on a journey through the memories of the four seasons—healing old wounds and awakening the courage to reconcile with themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending natural aesthetics with adventure and puzzle-solving, the game introduces a unique form of natural interaction: <i>breathing</i>. Players take on the role of a breeze in <i>Hoo~</i>, accompanying and aiding the protagonist on their journey. The wind has shape and emotion—every breath resonates with the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players control the character’s actions and environmental changes through the intensity and rhythm of their breath. Breathing directly influences the world’s dynamics: a gentle, long breath sets feathers dancing through the air; a steady, short puff pushes the character forward; and a warm exhale can awaken slumbering plants and spirits.</p>",
        "short_description": "Huuu~ is a healing interactive narrative game where players become a breeze, using breath to guide and comfort the protagonist. Drifting through the four seasons, they join in a quiet journey of reflection, emotion, and inner healing.",
